{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Bureau of Paranormal Investigation Season 2","Shen La, a special investigator of the \"Poll Bureau\" of the mysterious incident management agency, was seriously injured in the execution of his mission. When he was about to die, he accepted the inheritance of Wu Rendi, the director of the Sixth Office - a \"seed\" containing mysterious power. After regaining consciousness, Wu Rendi's senior brother Guangren accepted him as his disciple. In order to find the fragments of the Tianli Diagram, Shen La, after going through the Tianshan Wolf Tomb, energy backlash, foundation conspiracy and other incidents, was finally recognized by Wu Rendi and received the ancient artifact-the Twin Swords of Crime and Punishment given by him. At the same time, the problem of the insider in the polling bureau became more complicated and confusing, and Shen La and her partner Sun Desheng went into battle again.\n\n\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)"],"ja":["民调局异闻录 第2季",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":41917,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-59180","ids":{"shikimori":59180,"mal":59180,"anilist":185118,"kodik":"serial-61885"},"kodikIds":["serial-60635","serial-61885"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-60635":"2024-08-22T10:05:30Z","serial-61885":"2025-03-24T15:49:19Z"},"title":"Беловолосый Ла Шэнь","originalTitle":"Bai Fa Shen La","alt":"Bureau of Paranormal Investigation 2 Bureau of Paranormal Investigation Season 2 民调局异闻录 第2季","description":"Ла Шэнь Ла, специальный следователь «Опросного бюро» — таинственного агентства по расследованию необъяснимых происшествий, — была тяжело ранена при выполнении задания. Находясь на грани смерти, она приняла наследие У Жэньди У, главы Шестого управления, — «семя», хранящее в себе загадочную силу. Придя в сознание, она была принята в ученицы старшим братом У Жэньди по имени Гуанжэнь. В поисках фрагментов Схемы Тяньли Шэнь Ла прошла через испытания Гробницы Волка Тяньшань, энергетический откат, заговор Основания и другие события, и в итоге заслужила признание самого У Жэньди, получив от него древний артефакт — Парные мечи Преступления и Наказания. Тем временем проблема предателя внутри Опросного бюро становится всё запутаннее и сложнее, и Шэнь Ла вместе со своим напарником Сунь Дэшэном вновь вступают в бой.","year":2024,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.56,"popularity":313,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[41917],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/59180/bd2bb559ce8972da01955296f0cb23b2.jpeg","width":480,"height":640},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/85d415859c497c03e00766f0876d2bb8fa1deb65.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-60635","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1329966/72f0256a98fa1216a268c2e52abe13de/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1323","dubId":"1323","label":"LightFamily","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-61885","translationId":"1323","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1359853/a284fa9bae0b9db8785b10f8a8072bd9/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-60635","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1329967/00abfdac98db4ed5663c35fe7e13518f/720p","season":1,"ordinal":2}},{"id":"